'''The Pit''' is a dimension in which the [[Hellfire Gas (Raid Boss)]] resides.

==Spawning==
The player can spawn the The Pit by [[Trick Or Treating]] doors, where the user can interact with the event icon near the compass to get the exact portal location, as it's hidden in any door near the [[Mansion (Third Sea)]], [[Café]], and [[Middle Town]].

==Access==
To access the The Pit, players must first ensure that it has spawned. To insure, the screen will say Hellfire erupts from below. "Something is clawing its way out". Once confirmed, the first door leading to the structure must be activated.

==Trivia==
* After entering this place players can't exit until the boss dies or the player dies. When the boss dies players are teleported to [[Middle Town]], [[Café]] and [[Mansion (Third Sea)]].